  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposal, due to its design, scale, siting and relationship with the Conservation Area would cause significant harm to the setting of the Conservation Area and the overall character and appearance of the area. It is therefore not considered to comply with adopted Local Plan Policy CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), CC4 (Heritage) and SC4 (Scale and Density of New Housing Development).",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposal results in an over-provision of car parking and fails to demonstrate adequately that the proposed vehicular access would be safe to use and would not impair the safety of other road and footway users. This would not be in accordance with policy EC2 (Developing a sustainable local transport network) of the Local Plan."
